Rule 6 (k must not exceed the size of the operand along the reduction dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 ≥ 0 then v_2 ≤ shape(v_1, v_3) else v_2 ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) + v_3)
